.TH DRONE-SIMULATOR 6 "November 2026" "Drone Simulator @PROJECT_VERSION@" "Games Manual"
.SH NAME
drone-simulator \- realistic 3D simulator for aerial and ground drones
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B drone-simulator
.RB [ \-\-log\-level
.IR level ]
.RB [ \-\-gl\-debug ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.RB [ \-\-help ]
.RI [ qt-options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B drone-simulator
simulates aerial drones (multirotors) and ground drones (RC rovers) over procedural or
real-world terrain, with mission-based play, weather and a day/night sky.
.PP
It needs a graphics driver with OpenGL 4.5 core profile support. If none is available,
it shows an error with the detected OpenGL version and exits.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a summary of the options and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-log\-level " level"
Minimum level of the messages written to standard error:
.BR trace ", " debug ", " info " (default), " warn ", " error " or " off .
.TP
.B \-\-gl\-debug
Request an OpenGL debug context and log the messages of the graphics driver.
.PP
Standard Qt options such as
.B \-platform
and
.B \-style
are also accepted.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.BR F5 ", " F6 ", " F7 ", " F8
Start (or resume), pause, single step and reset the simulation.
.TP
.B Space
Arm or disarm the motors (vehicle cameras).
.TP
.BR W " / " S ", " A " / " D
Throttle up and down, yaw left and right (vehicle cameras); move the free camera.
.TP
.B Arrow keys
Pitch and roll (vehicle cameras); move the free camera.
.TP
.BR 1 " \- " 4
Flight mode: Acro, Angle, altitude hold, position hold.
.TP
.B C
Next camera: FPV, chase, line of sight, free.
.TP
.BR P ", " R
Pause or resume; reset the drone.
.TP
.B L
Navigation lights.
.TP
.B F11
Toggle full screen.
.TP
.B F9
Show or hide the tab panel.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /opt/drone_simulator/
Program files.
.TP
.I ~/.drone_simulation/
Per-user data (database, logs, caches). Removing the package does not touch it.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.B 0
on success,
.B 1
if OpenGL 4.5 core is not available or another fatal error occurs,
.B 2
for invalid command-line options.
